Added a driver for the Yokogawa AQ637x series optical spectrum analyzers (AQ6370C/AQ6373/AQ6375 and variants), covering the common IEEE-488.2 commands and the DISPlay, SENSe, TRACe, CALibration, TRIGger, MEMory, MMEMory, CALCulate (auto/manual/line markers), SYSTem, STATus, UNIT, template and data-logging subsystems, with a PyVISA-sim backend for CI. Spectral analysis (CALCulate WDM/NF/SMSR and MATH) is deferred to a future contribution.
